.DS_Store

# Source policy documents are never committed. They are county records that
# belong on the department's own systems, and this project treats the register
# as the artifact, not the sources. docs/README.md says where they go.
docs/*
!docs/README.md

# Deliverables produced outside this repository are not versioned here. The
# master report and the liability assessment in particular carry handling
# considerations that a repository does not respect.
deliverables/YDF_PREA_*
